-- **Main Interface (City Screen)**: Enhanced with a new **Great Person +n ICON** information in relevant Buildings' rows; added a new **Specialists Breakdown** and (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5384+) **Culture Breakdown**; added **optional extra rows** in the **Production Chooser Bar** and (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5361+) **optionally hide the unit bar** (`"PlotListPanel"`) (note: does not affect the production chooser outside of the city screen); added **Buttons** (i.e. icons) in the **Production Queue**; fixed some hard anchored items that now **dynamically** adjust to sides' width. **Beautified** it as well: removed the 3 gray bars ("Trade Routes", "Buildings", "Specialists"), increased sides' width, made bonuses columns even in width, and other changes. These changes allow to now display more information and reduce the need for scrolling or hovering. Also **enlarged** the **Bottom-Left** and **Bottom-Right** panels so they align dynamically with the enlarged **Side Panels**. Enhanced the **city bar** and **other bars**, e.g., `Lakamha: 16 - 12372 (4500BC)` or `Growing - 30/43 (4 Turns)`. Split the **Draft group** into hurry controls on the right (and a **new draft button**) and config options on the right. Add building list filtering buttons ("Show All Buildings", "Show Regular Buildings Only", "Show National Wonders Only", "Show World Wonders Only"). And other changes. Change in [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). See also [KI#101](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#101---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-gp-bar-tooltip-in-city-screen-not-showing-gp-from-obsolete-buildings-yet-seemignly-counting-them-for-the-total-gp-calculation).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5384+) **Main Interface (Map View)**: **Reordered buttons** (end turn, city change arrows) and wrapped them in a **pretty panel**. Added buttons to unit stack, selected unit.
-- Similarly Beautified and Enhanced the **Technology Advisor** in [CvTechChooser.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvTechChooser.py) so it uses more of the screen while still preserving key information. Players can **tune the advisor's width (4 different options)** in [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml). See [Customizable technology advisor width](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Tech_Tree.md#customizable-technology-advisor-width).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5319+) **Inverted BUG Options** for the **Technology Advisor** and the **Religious Advisor** so they are more accessible. They are now **enabled as a default**, and ticking their box disables them. Rewrote their text for clarity (e.g. "GP Research" -> **"Hide bulbing indicators"**). See [Inverted BUG options](/README.md#inverted-bug-options).
